# Publish the image with every push

When you commit and push this repository, that push must also build and publish the container image.

- Push with `git push` and leave git hooks enabled. Do not pass `--no-verify`.
- `.git/hooks/pre-push` runs `scripts/publish.sh`. That script builds `ghcr.io/mdbv/c1_imports`, pushes the date-versioned tag and `latest`, and pushes the matching git tag.
- If `.git/hooks/pre-push` is missing, install it from `scripts/hooks/pre-push` (executable) before pushing.
- The push is complete only after the script prints `Published ghcr.io/mdbv/c1_imports:...`.
